{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1223,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98023bc0bc2cd0da2285815b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果不全力以赴，\r\n就没有脸面对婚纱了！\r\n今天也要卯起来单挑啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535d777c31d6cddfa86ecfc4b453e4d65dc9e63ab9d57151d8d5b8001b57b435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e075ad515181a6a69d2129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然衣服飘来飘去的，不过\r\n确实很好跑步。尽管有点不稳定……\r\n但那家伙果然是一流的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "517eeafa7a90b2057313fe56d501d0ca874fe995c70a342f638b711c3b6d3c11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947f33882556a23e1426ccb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，衣服真的会让人跟着\r\n充满干劲啊！来来来，\r\n有没有人想跟我单挑啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39b800f6076aeefd0be6a389655cf0f8bb8c6b9e9c4e4f681a6e5f3e88736a8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b41ba57cb3a06c39d1fc43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你见识一下\r\n最强最棒的菱亚大姐，\r\n让你打从心底迷上我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e41c13984ed4c4e288245084e8f496a921158a112318e5d9e4fe40f726e2771b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0410179da131dbe12a978795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的路\r\n现在才要开始呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cea0bafbce96942f40a57b2b1d891f3477e6fd6e49460e62762c7d9c50ebae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33120e644c663d6a7c69ad7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是你待在我身边，\r\n我就能变强不少了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9a4238a30cebe17358df57ffb31218ade404efed95873f462874c4ed0d9da13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16965038f292c937607dbbff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后的日子还很长，\r\n但我相信只要你当我的伙伴，\r\n我就走得下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef311c29b2808667b28486c17951d0cc09e7f944248730b12f80ee67ca31a899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b0d3b28082450ce2383432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们二人的最强组合可是无敌的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f43159773d49430a70d6cd44e89978fe62536f05e911f82817e21310389a06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0848e898aeb226deed2cb1b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑出了好几场不错的比赛呢……谢啦、训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb05bcda8b1abdcf2caf5b5a5bf36ec713d9368b97c861c02a4d17808baaa739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5af31a41920916260c56c3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起，就会让我想相信命运。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07d30c95832f8b5f6b604d05c34b5cbd5e5449ff6d38f7511c2505d05ddfa283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720df418fc12ba44613fc24a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练公，\r\n谢谢你带给我最棒的每一天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da03b5ba951cd01a5a7f9da46e8485d4fd97a3aa65f450a143cebdc5760dd79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f59ba066f8a1d98270df77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错啊，感觉自己又变强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78298a7ce0f3b2e36d4fc644f811d8469bfef43564bdd3d1eafad89c9e1bf265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:288c8f0b2c3f0bf3fbcf2bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的真正实力可远远不止于此哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a74d039e42693dff837871f02c34454723c11213ab78c225b8f1db6346a59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2f84bb6ec5915e4ec097a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是菱亚马逊！请多指教了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ea49133fd10359d32660a8f2625cd5de88362831849a784df2cf117509bcba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6fcf78908170005697f6d1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单挑上等！\r\n就让我菱亚马逊姐来做你的对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a687fd7d6930110be0fc8b58e9a9def6f316a18e7187d593a0e00e8e77bae645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9a75f7a17afa9926910e48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管来依靠我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "884514a91f51aa6957ee977d5409fd9e1ca82c3cdb84efedbc28d36ba71fa311",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2549e87a20359ec0f2a5ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就交给你菱亚马逊姐我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8524ae516b2cbc56143d42d022fca2679bba78ff54b5719cd0630db46d3a47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e68f816f90d62782bd87ded",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔精心打扮一下也不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5453d540949deb7048df133f96c076a1ee79ae56ba0dd5742e0848ad8fc8372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34fa75a25df0a306ac6edc42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你找「女杰」菱亚马逊吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ff3c169d2551aef67805963836f3df69f24aedd410aab0a883b1da3a15f551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6349919f6f2d60e8d6508308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么时候，\r\n我都会带着你前进啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd06520ce752d352f1ca23011cd940a07d5578a5988e030906a18c75712156a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9bbd68a82c75692c8e5a6de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是菱亚马逊！\r\n跟我来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a4084ba0408cad9d1827ac8a116eed306f97a64621d266a4dd3f02eb40f7bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09965ec5a263126c00c6ff41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯有英勇奋战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d10428b52a3b6e999de21cbaa20ad3e9b4296b3705f8e3b36d80e6e72f5fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e59b8ca09a4bb3515a8e9e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃自己喜欢的东西是很幸福的呢……\r\n这都多亏了训练员为我设计的菜单哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "949679c2ec9a1701512c3a15f0eb55d6d840f39a9a56807f2a9ac6ab0ece10a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8408bafc0d41067ad1344818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行って参ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4987d3708730ebac0656ffbcb144c2a543ffd8cae52e81662000573920a03aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3bf80234fe4748ed86d8bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d7ee261bbe6dad3dbb0ae2cee1ae8e0c770f3e1fd45c49c24e6d025818369a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdd544d0873ea422db72477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是不可思议，\r\n不自觉地就会和训练员说出\r\n我的烦恼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6944e574dd198e6739fd85bca8b2197994db9e5f315d58f41009e5e54a9326ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea63e3adf5b6a5a0061c4e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要一起去看运动比赛？\r\n前提是你不介意\r\n看到我激动的模样就是了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e6992c22c3baf17d2454b78e522f935a1a5b389ed41b6efbc5d5f3fd544540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3299ed48d8d37f928d0fdd60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年我会更认真努力地精进自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1fe384d66e45adf64a1af4c50e14dafbfd8ec199a42cabc09910cdf405bec9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ba216401426565de90cd26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。\r\n请收下我的巧克力，\r\n当作答谢你平时对我的照顾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b347121de1d40a5ec2adae3913297c178645b8d43a16ee8d6351c2690ab3e8c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d87316a2898a78dfe66a1e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然比不上专业的味道，\r\n但这是我非常用心制作的巧克力……\r\n……你愿意吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd1ab5f409af282ddfa5da56240cd50af91005faf3952f5a25d4c896b0b6621",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da97dbc553f84e0032d1c41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向星星发誓，\r\n一定会达成我的夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3406042b36efcada41ea0d56c423a0874dd1112929e8729cfd1fa4da781ddd23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e9ea98cd7b0358fe279098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么万圣节嘛……\r\n呜呜……到处都是点心的诱惑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "663cf894e99debe87f7a073e98c54c4fd0d820cedea88ee237ed86eb95407a4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bd3018111efeaa1bfe140ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家每年圣诞节的时候，\r\n都会订制特大的蛋糕，\r\n然后一群人一起举办派对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e408d962514461e310363fef94c77842135d867976ff3c9090a57a1978ee64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd36fb6f75c69ac55ca97b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我可以晚一点再睡吗……？\r\n我想要和你一起好好享受圣诞节……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce52455df2dc5efa37b705f53aaf9f0bfe552c573d3ba569d422825b8359d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:533b55ca69172c142e33d7d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e9deba3fd1d32bb7e6ecc9fdd820f0ff3b0fc3c7d828d7babf2a4765856b130",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631d76e8ee6ce906d0c57ad0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也经历了许多的事情。\r\n希望可以不白费那些经验，\r\n好好地活用在明年呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c249940efffb9bf95061d8b1d448b8015d7f2fa35c92354a0c44665fc570db0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fddd564674af98e4f9ce53c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n这是一年只有一次的特别日子，\r\n我们就尽情地享受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c42e096ce54acc3542dc157bf200c64d07fe50d79e78993e272507a35f6b3c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5960dc1d2bc938469ebac066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n呵呵……你好像又变得更加可靠了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b9c2b94ebfdc08019f939a54f0b0cf4ebb6e0c17690823acd08f5944b3f052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6feab890753b398680fc6183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真的很感谢大家来为我祝贺。\r\n我得用成果来回报这份恩情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff6d73ce3ac52e01a6668f84de09fdc7baefa88d69f5aeaff11bd0039c8c6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896cdf3c42c4f0af102ff9fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为今天是我的生日，\r\n我可以稍微任性一下吗？\r\n……请你和我一起吃蛋糕吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f3307ce7ffbf74c46d47c7aefc4463067cbe7400ac086ba0a75911ecb8571c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00fe5b1490dbc20628fa214a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到了新公告。\r\n要确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc3b660072de3b4ec514a6958df8a5ddabcffc7413b53743697b73f25e541f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a50c2ec0a313837537a8570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物哦。\r\n很期待看到里面装着什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0f7942f17dc1c66ebeeb6830217c6c6292754a9acc442cbac3570ca04dc922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d68cc315fc3e4214c6d74a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有任务达成了。\r\n你的表现真是优秀呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ca39647c4bb23b3224e7a691e4e39eb3283fc69304235a61210b217164ea13d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:949afcc8482f17fc43b3f442",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像就快要举办活动了。\r\n很期待会是什么样的内容呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cfb0008918dbcdbf4a8168fcd130729ef0cd2ec2c7d78235195607b6c28d212",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
